## Project Title 
EXPENSEAPP


### Project Description
A user-friendly expense management app designed to help you understand where your money goes. The app lets you log expenses, assign categories, edit or delete entries, and view total spending in real time. With a clean interface and local data storage, it’s perfect for everyday budgeting and personal finance tracking.


### Features

Add, Edit & Delete Expenses — Quickly manage your transactions.

Categorized Spending — Tag expenses by category for better insights.

Local Storage Support — Your data stays saved in the browser.

Responsive UI — Works smoothly on desktop and mobile.

Summary & Filters

Total Spending

Category-wise breakdown

Date filters

 Tech Stack

Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript

Storage: Browser LocalStorage (or update this if your stack is different)

📦 Installation & Setup
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/tony-clex/expenseapp.git 

# Navigate into the project
cd expenseapp

# Open the project
open index.html  # or manually open in a browser



 Usage

Enter an amount, description, and category.

Click Add Expense.

Your expense appears in the list.

Use delete/edit buttons to modify entries.

View total and filtered summaries at the top.

